rooms_desc ({"The room is covered by black stucco \"walls\" everywhere you look, and is dimlylit by a single bubble lamp on the far side of the room.  On the left sideof this room, you see a black circular bed which is being inhabited by ablack and white leopard named Snuggles.  You try to pet Snuggles, but thenrealize that you know better.  You really have grown attached to your lefthand.  On the right side you see a gleaming mirror finish Tuba standingupon a pedestal.  Next to the Tuba, you see a gleaming Hematite Mellophone,obviously the world's most perfect instrument.  You suddenly feel at piece asyou stare at the giant \"Etch A Sketch\" on the right wall.     After doodling on the toy for an hour, you return to the land of reality,and sit on the enormous black leather bean bag chair.  As you rifle throughWhiplashes frige, you notice that the only things in there are Sun-Dropand cans of squirty cheese.  Upon careful inspection, you see that all theSun-Drop has the initials \"SH\" on them.  You inspect Whiplash's CD collectionand see that he owns really dorky CD's.  Titles like Yoko Ono, Nana Masourki,James Taylor, Ramones, Steel Pulse, and Billy Joel can hardly be consideredmainstream.  As you get comfortable, Snuggles gently plops on your lap.","		Snuggles follows you into the rec room...This is the lavish rec room of Whiplash.  In the middle of the room is a redpool table with several balls scattered atop.  The triangle has been lost,and Whiplash does not feel like replacing it.  Near the back of the roomis a Table Tennis Table, and next to that is a very large trophy case with several paddles, balls, and other assorted trophies.  If you try to play him,you will be utterly demolished, so don't do it.  Next to the table is a bar.On tap at the bar are over 46 brands of Beer, Ale, Stout and other assortedalcoholic beverages.  However, there are no glasses in sight.  hmmm.....	You find yourself playing Mortal Kombat 3 for several hours, andfinally decide to relax on the movie theatre seats watching Clue over, and over,and over again.	You awake about 4 hours later and stumble to your feet, dizzy.......","	\"Lay out all your troubles upon thy throne, and ye shall be merry\",reads the sign above this door.  Cute.  anywho, as you might have guessed,this is the bathroom.  very pleasent.  very quaint.  very yellow.  Yes myfriends, this bathroom is yellow.  Deal with it.  Everything is yellow inthis room, right down to the anti-bacterial handsoap in the canary yellowdispenser.  You are wisked away into a magical land of Banana's, canaries,lemons, sunshine, and Professors wardrobes.  If you get sick of the color, well,you're in the right place!  Aim carefully!*	Oh, umm......Snuggles followed you in here too, but you shooo him away.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This room is entirely Blue and White, with a touch of Gold, just as it shouldbe.  Over in the closet are numerous letter jerseys and other assortedregalia all pertaining to Kappa Kappa Psi.  Over on the left wall, you notice the words \"Strive for the Highest\" intricately painted upon it.You see the Big Book of Secret Stuff! over near the south wall.  FeelFree to look!",0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"You enter the house of Whiplash, which is perfectly spherical, and is     monochromatic from top to bottom.","This is the rec room.","This is the Bathroom","A brand new room, ready to be decorated","Yes, my friends, the Kappa Kappa Psi Room.",0,0,0,0,0,})
